    <string name="about_content_review_body">Littattafan Al-Qur\'ani, hadisi da nassoshin adhkar suna yin nazari na musamman na addini, daban da na\'urar tantancewa, kafin a fito da su a hukumance. Tushen rubutun Alqur\'ani: Tanzil project (rubutun Uthmani).</string>
