    <string name="about_license_body">Musulmi cikakken kyauta ne, buɗaɗɗen tushe app ƙarƙashin lasisin GPLv3 - babu talla, babu biyan kuɗi, babu bin diddigi. Duk wani sigar da aka gyara yana zama a buɗe tushen.</string>
    <string name="about_license_title">Lasisi</string>
